<title>UK: SOCCER-NORTHERN IRISH CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORTHERN IRISH CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BELFAST 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of</p>
<p>quarter-final matches in the Northern Irish Cup on Saturday:</p>
<p> Cliftonville	    3  Crusaders		 1</p>
<p> Glentoran		 4  Coagh United	    0</p>
<p> Loughgall United	1  Coleraine		 1</p>
<p> Omagh Town		2  Limvady United	  2</p>
